WEBVTT

00:18.220 --> 00:21.310
<b>Even the great Oni comes down with a cold, eh?</b>

00:21.480 --> 00:24.520
<b>Well, the fever's already gone down.</b>

00:25.060 --> 00:26.560
<b>You must stay in bed.</b>

00:26.730 --> 00:32.150
<b>Dr. Ryusen advised that you should take time
to recuperate, remember?</b>

00:33.610 --> 00:36.820
<b>I'd call this a windfall sickness.</b>

00:37.530 --> 00:38.950
<b>If you need anything,</b>

00:39.120 --> 00:40.620
<b>please, call me.</b>

00:40.790 --> 00:42.790
<b>Yes, got it.</b>

00:45.120 --> 00:46.880
<b>-Is she gone?
-Yes.</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:48.090
<b>All right, take it out.</b>

00:53.470 --> 00:54.510
<b>Delicious.</b>

00:55.130 --> 00:58.390
<b>Drinking in secret is exceptionally delightful.</b>

00:58.930 --> 01:02.270
<b>Liquor is not the only delicious thing.</b>

01:03.810 --> 01:07.350
<b>I can't be without this.</b>

01:13.990 --> 01:16.860
<b>It sure looks delicious when you smoke.</b>

01:17.030 --> 01:20.370
<b>Tobacco tastes especially good in this pipe.</b>

01:20.530 --> 01:22.870
<b>Is it some kind of special pipe?</b>

01:23.040 --> 01:26.080
<b>This is a portable silver pipe</b>

01:26.250 --> 01:28.080
<b>made by Heizaemon Goto,</b>

01:28.250 --> 01:31.340
<b>who's known as a master pipe maker.</b>

01:31.800 --> 01:33.170
<b>My late father</b>

01:33.340 --> 01:37.090
<b>commissioned him to make this
when he served for the Kyoto magistrate.</b>

01:37.260 --> 01:39.010
<b>It's nothing luxurious.</b>

01:39.180 --> 01:41.760
<b>But look at the back side of this.</b>

01:41.930 --> 01:44.770
<b>A nail puller family crest.</b>

01:44.930 --> 01:50.900
<b>Anyhow, my father invested
15 ryo in this silver pipe.</b>

01:51.320 --> 01:53.730
<b>It's a memento of your late father.</b>

01:54.190 --> 01:55.650
<b>Right.</b>

02:57.510 --> 03:01.800
<b>Inkyo of Okawa River</b>

03:02.930 --> 03:06.600
<b>It's taking unexpectedly long for you to recover.</b>

03:07.680 --> 03:09.690
<b>Don't tell Hisae.</b>

03:09.850 --> 03:12.610
<b>I had a little bit to drink
with Samanosuke yesterday.</b>

03:13.310 --> 03:15.650
<b>That's why it came back.</b>

03:15.820 --> 03:17.570
<b>Don't say that.</b>

03:17.740 --> 03:20.450
<b>I'm regretting it now.</b>

03:20.610 --> 03:24.620
<b>I'll be fine, as long as I rest all day today.</b>

03:25.370 --> 03:28.080
<b>I appreciate you for taking over
my duties while I recover.</b>

03:28.250 --> 03:29.250
<b>Of course.</b>

03:50.730 --> 03:53.770
<b>When did I get so weak?</b>

03:53.940 --> 03:56.360
<b>How could a cold take me down like this?</b>

03:56.520 --> 03:59.320
<b>I never imagined this would ever happen.</b>

04:08.870 --> 04:11.210
<b>-My.
-I feel great this morning.</b>

04:11.370 --> 04:12.870
<b>See?</b>

04:14.210 --> 04:17.380
<b>You're a completely different person from yesterday.</b>

04:17.960 --> 04:19.800
<b>Look at that.</b>

04:22.720 --> 04:23.720
<b>Delicious.</b>

04:24.430 --> 04:26.100
<b>You must be careful.</b>

04:26.260 --> 04:30.890
<b>Dr. Ryusen advised that you rest for three months.</b>

04:31.060 --> 04:32.060
<b>That's absurd.</b>

04:32.230 --> 04:34.770
<b>He said that as a joke.</b>

04:34.940 --> 04:39.360
<b>If I lie in bed for three months,
I'll start growing mold.</b>

04:39.530 --> 04:41.570
<b>Would you want that?</b>

04:41.740 --> 04:44.150
<b>Try sleeping with your moldy husband.</b>

04:44.320 --> 04:47.030
<b>You'll contract the mold too.</b>

04:47.200 --> 04:50.240
<b>Please, don't say such a thing so loudly.</b>

04:51.660 --> 04:53.040
<b>By the way, Hisae...</b>

04:53.210 --> 04:55.370
<b>-Yes?
-I've got a request.</b>

04:56.040 --> 04:58.170
<b>I need to smoke one.</b>

04:58.340 --> 05:00.750
<b>Are you talking about tobacco?</b>

05:00.920 --> 05:04.760
<b>Of course. What else would I be talking about?</b>

05:04.930 --> 05:06.140
<b>I won't allow it.</b>

05:06.300 --> 05:10.350
<b>Dr. Ryusen absolutely prohibits you
from smoking tobacco.</b>

05:11.680 --> 05:17.350
<b>Is it okay for Heizo Hasegawa's wife
to be so inflexible?</b>

05:17.520 --> 05:19.820
<b>Well, if you say that...</b>

05:22.820 --> 05:25.570
<b>Just promise me that you'll only have one.</b>

05:27.910 --> 05:29.120
<b>What's the matter?</b>

05:29.280 --> 05:30.410
<b>It's gone.</b>

05:30.580 --> 05:31.580
<b>What is?</b>

05:31.740 --> 05:35.250
<b>Your father's pipe.</b>

05:36.290 --> 05:37.540
<b>Look carefully.</b>

05:38.920 --> 05:40.630
<b>It's gone.</b>

05:40.790 --> 05:44.130
<b>Before I went to bed last night,</b>

05:44.300 --> 05:47.470
<b>I clearly remember storing it here.</b>

05:47.630 --> 05:49.720
<b>What? Look for it.</b>

05:49.890 --> 05:51.810
<b>Let's search around more.</b>

06:00.360 --> 06:03.280
<b>I wonder what's going on.</b>

06:03.440 --> 06:05.530
<b>-That's enough.
-What?</b>

06:05.690 --> 06:07.200
<b>But, Hisae,</b>

06:07.360 --> 06:09.740
<b>do not tell anybody about this.</b>

06:09.910 --> 06:11.660
<b>You must have an idea, then?</b>

06:12.410 --> 06:15.950
<b>If I do, it'd be a disaster.</b>

06:16.120 --> 06:20.670
<b>That means theft was committed
at the Arson Theft Control official's residence.</b>

06:22.250 --> 06:24.670
<b>Yes, I understand.</b>

06:29.930 --> 06:34.060
<b>What in the world is really happening?</b>

06:43.860 --> 06:45.030
<b>Are you headed out?</b>

06:45.570 --> 06:49.070
<b>I thought I'd go patrol the city for a change.</b>

06:49.240 --> 06:51.490
<b>Let me accompany you.</b>

06:51.660 --> 06:53.410
<b>If you come with me,</b>

06:53.580 --> 06:55.580
<b>I'm afraid that cold would strike back.</b>

06:55.740 --> 06:57.910
<b>Oh, come on, Tetsu.</b>

06:58.080 --> 07:01.920
<b>Let's get out and celebrate with a toast to health.</b>

07:02.080 --> 07:03.710
<b>That's exactly what I mean.</b>

07:03.880 --> 07:05.210
<b>You're dangerous.</b>

07:05.380 --> 07:07.920
<b>What's dangerous?</b>

07:09.050 --> 07:10.220
<b>Nothing.</b>

07:10.380 --> 07:11.930
<b>I'm headed out.</b>

07:12.090 --> 07:14.050
<b>Take care.</b>

07:18.770 --> 07:20.190
<b>I'm a little tired.</b>

07:20.390 --> 07:21.600
<b>Shall we have a drink?</b>

07:21.770 --> 07:27.190
<b>That's what I've been waiting to hear, Tetsu.</b>

07:27.990 --> 07:30.490
<b>How about that boathouse, Kagaya?</b>

07:30.650 --> 07:32.160
<b>Do you know the place?</b>

07:32.320 --> 07:33.870
<b>No, it would be my first time.</b>

07:34.030 --> 07:36.700
<b>It'd be more interesting that way.</b>

07:37.620 --> 07:42.330
<b>At any rate, it'd be good
to get out and see the Okawa River.</b>

07:43.830 --> 07:45.500
<b>Hello.</b>

07:48.800 --> 07:50.050
<b>It's our first time here.</b>

07:50.220 --> 07:51.550
<b>Welcome.</b>

07:51.720 --> 07:53.590
<b>Are you sure, Tetsu?</b>

07:53.760 --> 07:55.180
<b>He's quite the elder.</b>

07:56.310 --> 08:00.310
<b>This boatman looks like
a shriveled-up grilled fish cake.</b>

08:04.690 --> 08:05.690
<b>Samanosuke.</b>

08:05.860 --> 08:09.990
<b>This boatman could
face a tornado head-on.</b>

08:12.700 --> 08:14.110
<b>What is your name?</b>

08:14.280 --> 08:15.280
<b>Yes.</b>

08:15.450 --> 08:17.080
<b>It's Tomogoro.</b>

08:17.620 --> 08:20.750
<b>My name's Samataro Kishii.</b>

08:20.910 --> 08:22.160
<b>Remember it.</b>

08:22.330 --> 08:24.670
<b>I'm gonna be a regular customer of yours.</b>

08:35.470 --> 08:37.930
<b>Will you make a stop right there?</b>

08:38.100 --> 08:41.140
<b>-A relative of my mother lives here.
-Yes.</b>

08:41.310 --> 08:44.600
<b>-Thanks.
-Take your time.</b>

09:21.560 --> 09:23.140
<b>What's the matter, boss?</b>

09:23.310 --> 09:25.850
<b>Nothing.</b>

09:35.570 --> 09:39.320
<b>Sorry to put you through this,
but this has to be kept between us.</b>

09:39.490 --> 09:41.240
<b>What's the matter?</b>

09:41.870 --> 09:43.580
<b>By the Shian Bridge,</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:46.080
<b>there's a boathouse called Kagaya.</b>

09:46.290 --> 09:49.750
<b>A boatman named Tomogoro works there.</b>

09:50.590 --> 09:53.380
<b>I need you to investigate him.</b>

09:53.550 --> 09:55.720
<b>Don't let him notice you.</b>

09:55.880 --> 09:57.260
<b>Understood.</b>

10:01.640 --> 10:03.310
<b>Are you going for an investigation?</b>

10:03.470 --> 10:06.520
<b>Nothing serious like that.</b>

10:15.780 --> 10:17.110
<b>Excuse me.</b>

10:17.780 --> 10:20.200
<b>I would like to order a boat.</b>

10:20.370 --> 10:22.780
<b>Heard there was a skilled boatman here.</b>

10:25.450 --> 10:28.210
<b>Old man, may I...?</b>

10:30.080 --> 10:34.170
<b>Is there something stuck on my face?</b>

10:34.340 --> 10:35.920
<b>Pops?</b>

10:37.590 --> 10:40.010
<b>Is that you, Kumehachi?</b>

10:40.180 --> 10:42.550
<b>Never thought I'd see you here.</b>

10:42.720 --> 10:45.220
<b>That's for me to say.</b>

10:45.390 --> 10:49.440
<b>It's been ten years since
we worked together as thieves.</b>

10:49.600 --> 10:52.610
<b>That was my last job, and now I'm here.</b>

10:52.770 --> 10:55.110
<b>So you're the boatman here?</b>

10:55.610 --> 10:59.700
<b>I don't go by my thief name,
Tomozo of Hamazaki, anymore.</b>

10:59.860 --> 11:02.490
<b>I'm the respectable boatman, Tomogoro.</b>

11:03.740 --> 11:05.490
<b>Tomogoro?</b>

11:07.830 --> 11:11.290
<b>Are you really not a thief anymore?</b>

11:11.460 --> 11:13.960
<b>As you can see.</b>

11:14.130 --> 11:17.260
<b>So, who do you work for now?</b>

11:17.880 --> 11:21.840
<b>Actually, ever since
Master Tanbei of Chigashira</b>

11:22.010 --> 11:24.970
<b>got arrested by Arson Theft Control
three years ago,</b>

11:25.140 --> 11:27.560
<b>I've been working for various people.</b>

11:27.720 --> 11:30.480
<b>So you're wandering about?</b>

11:30.640 --> 11:32.520
<b>Guess you could say that.</b>

11:32.690 --> 11:36.360
<b>But it's been hard
to find work in Edo recently.</b>

11:36.530 --> 11:38.900
<b>I'm sure you've heard about it too.</b>

11:39.070 --> 11:43.320
<b>As long as Heizo the Oni
is the chief of Arson Theft Control,</b>

11:43.490 --> 11:45.280
<b>it's hard to make a move at all.</b>

11:46.870 --> 11:49.000
<b>If it were the old me,</b>

11:49.160 --> 11:51.330
<b>I wouldn't let Heizo the Oni get in my way.</b>

11:51.500 --> 11:52.670
<b>Is that right?</b>

11:52.830 --> 11:56.340
<b>In fact, I wouldn't be worried about it
at all, even today.</b>

11:59.970 --> 12:01.300
<b>What's the matter?</b>

12:01.470 --> 12:02.930
<b>Kumehachi...</b>

12:03.090 --> 12:04.930
<b>Let me tell you something,</b>

12:05.100 --> 12:07.140
<b>since you're an old friend.</b>

12:08.350 --> 12:09.720
<b>What is it?</b>

12:09.890 --> 12:13.230
<b>I won against Heizo the Oni.</b>

12:15.060 --> 12:18.610
<b>Because of all the praises I've been hearing</b>

12:18.780 --> 12:23.360
<b>about Onihei, it stirred up the thief inside me.</b>

12:26.830 --> 12:27.910
<b>Did you...?</b>

12:28.080 --> 12:30.080
<b>Exactly.</b>

12:30.250 --> 12:35.000
<b>Last week, I snuck into
the Arson Theft Control official's residence.</b>

12:50.640 --> 12:53.690
<b>When did I get so weak?</b>

12:53.850 --> 12:56.270
<b>How could a cold take me down like this?</b>

12:56.440 --> 12:58.440
<b>I never imagined this would ever happen.</b>

13:05.740 --> 13:08.780
<b>Here's the proof.</b>

13:12.120 --> 13:16.040
<b>Heizo the Oni? Don't let that name discourage you.</b>

13:16.210 --> 13:19.920
<b>He was asleep, and didn't notice my presence at all.</b>

13:20.090 --> 13:24.340
<b>He's acting big because
today's thieves are all cowards.</b>

13:28.050 --> 13:29.220
<b>Pops.</b>

13:29.390 --> 13:31.720
<b>Have you seen the face of Heizo the Oni?</b>

13:31.890 --> 13:34.980
<b>Not too clearly. The room was pretty dark.</b>

13:35.140 --> 13:36.980
<b>I see.</b>

13:37.150 --> 13:42.570
<b>Kumehachi, even a 68-year old geezer like me
could pull this off.</b>

13:42.730 --> 13:47.110
<b>Why don't you surprise Heizo the Oni</b>

13:47.280 --> 13:50.950
<b>with a true robbery job here,
in the center of Edo?</b>

13:52.450 --> 13:55.000
<b>Why, this is intriguing.</b>

13:55.160 --> 13:57.290
<b>That's the truth.</b>

13:59.460 --> 14:01.800
<b>What have you done, Pops?</b>

14:02.250 --> 14:08.470
<b>I never imagined a thief would
rob an Arson Theft Control official's residence.</b>

14:08.640 --> 14:14.100
<b>-It proves how the officials here are all asleep.
-But...</b>

14:14.720 --> 14:16.850
<b>For Tomozo of Hamazaki...</b>

14:17.020 --> 14:18.100
<b>No.</b>

14:18.270 --> 14:22.820
<b>For Tomogoro, this was an easy act.</b>

14:22.980 --> 14:25.990
<b>Even so...</b>

14:27.280 --> 14:30.120
<b>He made me lose my face as Heizo the Oni.</b>

14:30.870 --> 14:33.620
<b>I deeply apologize for this.</b>

14:33.790 --> 14:36.080
<b>There's no need for you to apologize.</b>

14:37.960 --> 14:39.620
<b>Well...</b>

14:39.790 --> 14:41.330
<b>We'll be arresting Pops.</b>

14:41.880 --> 14:43.840
<b>Even if it's just one pipe,</b>

14:44.000 --> 14:46.170
<b>theft is theft.</b>

14:46.340 --> 14:48.430
<b>Yes, but...</b>

14:48.590 --> 14:51.390
<b>Are you asking me to let him go?</b>

14:54.890 --> 14:59.020
<b>Well, let me think about it over a drink.</b>

15:01.980 --> 15:04.770
<b>What's this great story you want to tell me?</b>

15:06.740 --> 15:08.530
<b>I'm feeling uncomfortable now.</b>

15:08.700 --> 15:11.820
<b>-Pops, I snuck in too.
-What?</b>

15:12.280 --> 15:17.000
<b>I'm sure that building had all sorts of faults
when you snuck in, Pops.</b>

15:17.160 --> 15:21.080
<b>But ever since you stole Onihei's silver pipe,</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:23.040
<b>security's gotten more strict.</b>

15:23.540 --> 15:24.960
<b>But...</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:26.800
<b>I, Kumehachi of Kobusa,</b>

15:26.960 --> 15:29.470
<b>never took a ten-year hiatus
from robbing like you did.</b>

15:29.630 --> 15:31.590
<b>I'm an active thief.</b>

15:31.800 --> 15:33.760
<b>I couldn't give up.</b>

15:33.930 --> 15:36.310
<b>I decided to go for it.</b>

15:41.900 --> 15:45.270
<b>What? If you don't believe me...</b>

15:45.440 --> 15:46.690
<b>See?</b>

15:48.110 --> 15:49.240
<b>It's true.</b>

15:49.820 --> 15:52.740
<b>Pops, I know this provokes you.</b>

15:53.240 --> 15:54.240
<b>Very well.</b>

15:54.820 --> 16:00.710
<b>I'll show you. I'll sneak into the Arson Theft Control
official's residence with heightened security.</b>

16:00.870 --> 16:03.460
<b>Then why don't you do this?</b>

16:03.630 --> 16:10.170
<b>I'll sneak in again to put
this seal case inside the cabinet.</b>

16:10.340 --> 16:13.800
<b>Pops, you'll put that pipe back in its cabinet,</b>

16:13.970 --> 16:16.720
<b>to steal this seal case instead.</b>

16:16.890 --> 16:19.220
<b>-If you do that...
-What is it?</b>

16:19.850 --> 16:20.890
<b>All right.</b>

16:21.060 --> 16:23.060
<b>I, Kumehachi, will reward you</b>

16:23.230 --> 16:24.850
<b>with 30 golden ryo.</b>

16:25.020 --> 16:26.110
<b>Really?</b>

16:26.270 --> 16:27.360
<b>I don't lie.</b>

16:27.520 --> 16:29.480
<b>When are you returning that seal case?</b>

16:29.650 --> 16:31.190
<b>Tonight.</b>

16:32.490 --> 16:34.610
<b>Isn't it funny, Pops?</b>

16:34.780 --> 16:39.240
<b>Two old buddies are leading
Heizo the Oni around by his nose.</b>

16:39.410 --> 16:41.200
<b>It's true.</b>

16:42.410 --> 16:44.710
<b>All right, it's inside this drawer.</b>

16:45.710 --> 16:49.130
<b>Mr. Hasegawa,
please, don't hurt Pops.</b>

16:49.300 --> 16:50.590
<b>Don't worry.</b>

16:50.760 --> 16:52.380
<b>I won't mention you either.</b>

16:52.550 --> 16:53.590
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:59.640 --> 17:01.730
<b>Kumehachi's been around a lot recently.</b>

17:01.890 --> 17:03.980
<b>Is there a special investigation going on?</b>

17:04.140 --> 17:07.360
<b>Then you would be in the know about it.</b>

17:08.060 --> 17:12.610
<b>Kumehachi's here to play a game with me.</b>

17:24.410 --> 17:27.210
<b>-He's coming tonight.
-Got it.</b>

17:38.930 --> 17:40.640
<b>The old man's here.</b>

17:47.850 --> 17:51.650
<b>Will he come and look at my face?</b>

18:15.590 --> 18:20.470
<b>Last night, a thief snuck in
and stole a seal case from my bedroom.</b>

18:23.560 --> 18:25.640
<b>If the town knows about this...</b>

18:26.180 --> 18:29.150
<b>No, if other thieves know about this,</b>

18:29.310 --> 18:31.020
<b>our dignity falls to the ground,</b>

18:31.190 --> 18:33.530
<b>and we'd be the laughingstock of the town.</b>

18:33.980 --> 18:35.530
<b>All of us, including me,</b>

18:35.690 --> 18:37.400
<b>will need to be on high alert</b>

18:37.570 --> 18:39.610
<b>to serve our duties from here on out.</b>

18:39.780 --> 18:42.240
<b>If this happens ever again,</b>

18:42.410 --> 18:43.910
<b>I, Heizo Hasegawa,</b>

18:44.080 --> 18:46.330
<b>will immediately resign from my position.</b>

18:46.580 --> 18:48.540
<b>Understood.</b>

18:49.170 --> 18:51.080
<b>That was unexpected.</b>

18:51.250 --> 18:54.800
<b>Who would've thought we'd get robbed?</b>

18:54.960 --> 18:56.630
<b>Is this funny to you?</b>

18:56.800 --> 18:59.220
<b>Are you that happy about our failure?</b>

18:59.380 --> 19:01.180
<b>Of course not.</b>

19:01.340 --> 19:03.220
<b>It's not just us.</b>

19:03.390 --> 19:04.470
<b>It's about Chief too.</b>

19:04.640 --> 19:09.980
<b>The thief snuck into his bedroom
while he was asleep.</b>

19:12.150 --> 19:14.230
<b>Boathouse: Kagaya</b>

19:18.070 --> 19:20.990
<b>Was it Mr. Kishii?</b>

19:21.160 --> 19:23.320
<b>So you did remember.</b>

19:23.490 --> 19:27.370
<b>What a good feeling</b>

19:27.540 --> 19:30.830
<b>I have tonight</b>

19:31.000 --> 19:34.920
<b>Crane and tortoise
Crane and tortoise</b>

19:35.460 --> 19:38.090
<b>Did something good happen?</b>

19:38.260 --> 19:40.170
<b>Did you meet a young woman?</b>

19:40.340 --> 19:41.630
<b>Of course not.</b>

19:41.800 --> 19:45.510
<b>I'm almost 70, you know?</b>

19:45.680 --> 19:48.430
<b>It's like a hazy moon of spring.</b>

19:48.600 --> 19:49.770
<b>But you know, boss?</b>

19:49.930 --> 19:52.190
<b>It's gonna rain tomorrow.</b>

19:52.350 --> 19:53.610
<b>What are you saying?</b>

19:53.770 --> 19:55.440
<b>The moon's out.</b>

19:55.610 --> 20:00.150
<b>Inkyo of Okawa River
is more reliable than the moon.</b>

20:00.320 --> 20:01.570
<b>Inkyo of Okawa River?</b>

20:01.740 --> 20:03.570
<b>See?</b>

20:03.740 --> 20:05.830
<b>He's coming out over there.</b>

20:08.580 --> 20:09.620
<b>Hey, Inkyo.</b>

20:09.790 --> 20:11.660
<b>Long time no see.</b>

20:26.220 --> 20:27.430
<b>Hey, Inkyo.</b>

20:27.600 --> 20:30.100
<b>You look strong and healthy.</b>

20:33.560 --> 20:36.360
<b>Boss. Inkyo has been</b>

20:36.520 --> 20:39.570
<b>living in the Okawa River for 70 to 80 years.</b>

20:39.730 --> 20:40.900
<b>Really?</b>

20:41.070 --> 20:44.160
<b>I've known him ever since I was a young boy.</b>

20:44.320 --> 20:47.490
<b>He can differentiate the voices of the boatmen,</b>

20:47.660 --> 20:50.580
<b>and shows up when I'm around.</b>

20:53.710 --> 20:55.790
<b>See you later, Inkyo.</b>

20:56.880 --> 20:59.460
<b>A koi fish that big is a beast.</b>

20:59.630 --> 21:01.800
<b>I won't deny that.</b>

21:02.420 --> 21:04.550
<b>Thanks for the spectacle.</b>

21:04.720 --> 21:08.300
<b>In exchange, I'd like you
to join me for a drink.</b>

21:09.260 --> 21:10.560
<b>Let me pour you some.</b>

21:10.720 --> 21:13.850
<b>Why, thank you, boss.</b>

21:14.020 --> 21:16.100
<b>We're about to enjoy a delicious meal.</b>

21:16.310 --> 21:17.810
<b>Why not relax and live a little?</b>

21:18.520 --> 21:21.610
<b>I've never met such a good-natured samurai before.</b>

21:21.780 --> 21:24.650
<b>I assume that you're a wealthy ronin,</b>

21:24.820 --> 21:26.610
<b>but what do you do?</b>

21:26.780 --> 21:29.240
<b>Well, you know...</b>

21:29.410 --> 21:32.620
<b>I'm curious to hear about your stories, old man.</b>

21:32.790 --> 21:37.380
<b>There's nothing impressive about my life.</b>

21:37.540 --> 21:39.210
<b>Are you sure?</b>

21:49.300 --> 21:51.010
<b>Pops.</b>

21:51.180 --> 21:54.140
<b>Will you return my seal case for this ryo?</b>

21:54.310 --> 21:58.150
<b>The pipe and seal case
are mementos of my late father.</b>

21:58.310 --> 22:02.030
<b>They're both very precious to me.</b>

22:21.250 --> 22:27.550
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.720 --> 22:33.390
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.560 --> 22:39.350
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.690 --> 22:45.110
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:48.070 --> 22:50.360
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.530 --> 22:54.370
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.540 --> 22:59.420
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.290 --> 23:05.380
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:11.590
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.300 --> 23:15.220
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.480 --> 23:23.860
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:27.240 --> 23:33.240
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:42.210 --> 23:45.170
<b>Heizo had a fateful encounter.</b>

23:45.960 --> 23:49.170
<b>The person is his unforgettable teacher.</b>

23:50.340 --> 23:53.430
<b>Next on Onihei,
"Crossroads."</b>

23:53.590 --> 23:55.050
<b>Crossroads</b>
